title: ArmadilloInitialDialogue
---
<<change_camera_target DialogueManager Armadillo>>
<<disable_player_ui DialogueManager true>>

Armadillo: Ughh, dang it... I knew I should've bought spare tools...
Armadillo: ...huh!? Who's there!?
Armadillo: H-hey, stay back! I don't know what you are, but...
Armadillo: ...
Armadillo: ...you're not here to hurt me, are you?

Green Soul: ...

Armadillo: Well, I guess if you didn't bite me yet you're probably not gonna bite me at all.
Armadillo: ...considering how all the other creatures here have been behaving, hahaha...

Green Soul: ...

Amanda Armadillo: A-hem. Guess I'll introduce myself. Name's Amanda. Amanda Armadillo.

Green Soul: ...

Amanda Armadillo: Silence, huh? Since you're still staring at me I'll assume you just can't speak.
Amanda Armadillo: Say, little Green Guy, have you by any chance seen a drill somewhere around here?
Amanda Armadillo: I uh... got jumped by a group of snakes and I dropped it as I ran away...

Green Soul: ...

Amanda Armadillo: Well, don't look at me like that! 
Amanda Armadillo: Actually, I guess that's the only way you look, since you don't really have a face...
Amanda Armadillo: ANYWAY, if you do see a drill, let me know. I'll probably stay around here.
Amanda Armadillo: See you around!

<<change_camera_target DialogueManager Player>>
<<enable_movement RightArmadilloTrigger>>
<<enable_movement LeftArmadilloTrigger>>
<<disable_player_ui DialogueManager false>>
<<disable_dialogue_trigger DialogueManager RightArmadilloTrigger>>
<<disable_dialogue_trigger DialogueManager LeftArmadilloTrigger>>
===
